flowchart TD
    Start([Start Game]) --> InputNum[Player guesses a number]
    InputNum --> CheckGuess{Is the guess correct?}
    
    CheckGuess -- Too Low --> LowHint(["Too low! Try again."]) --> InputNum
    CheckGuess -- Too High --> HighHint(["Too high! Try again."]) --> InputNum
    CheckGuess -- Correct --> Win([You guessed it!])
    
    Win --> End([Game Over])
